  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="unit_tierce_cb24d784fe99cfad50bd3403bb397bc0731a8c89519539119509e3ab27edf7bf77">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>an old measure of capacity equivalent to one third of a pipe (usually 42 gallons) (OED s.v. tierce 3) | a third | a measure of capacity equivalent to one third of a pipe (usually 42 gallons old wine measure, but varying for different commodities); also a cask or vessel holding this quantity; also such a cask with its contents (OED s.v. tierce 3), here as a measure of prunes | an old measure of capacity equivalent to one third of a pipe (usually 42 gallons old wine measure, but varying for different commodities); also a cask or vessel holding this quantity, here of wine (OED s.v. tierce 3) | a liquid measure for wine, equivalent to a third of a tun, i.e. 84 wine gallons (= 70 imperial gallons) (OED s.v. tertian a. and n. 2), here of wine | a liquid measure for wine equivalent to a third of a tun, i.e. 84 wine gallons (= 70 imperial gallons) (OED s.v. tertian a.and n. 2), here of wine | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc. (⅓ tun, 84 gallons), usually 1/3 of previous unit of measure, here a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc. (⅓ tun, 84 gallons), usually 1/3 of previous unit of measure, here a measure of soap | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc. (⅓ tun, 84 gallons), usually ⅓ of previous unit of measure, here a measure of currants (kurrans), dates | a liquid measure for wine, oil, etc., the third of a tun, i.e. 84 wine gallons (= 70 imperial gallons); also, a large cask of this capacity; a puncheon (OED s.v. tertian a.and n. 2), here as a measure of currants | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc. (⅓ tun, 84 gallons), usually ⅓ of previous unit of measure, here a measure of prunes | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc., ⅓ of a tun (84 gallons) (OED s.v. tertian a. and n. 2), here as a packing unit for rabbit skins | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc., ⅓ of a tun (84 gallons) (OED s.v. tertian a. and n. 2), here as a measure of laurel oil | an obsolete liquid measure for wine, oil etc., ⅓ of a tun (84 gallons) (OED s.v. tertian a. and n. 2), here as a measure of raisins, cheese | as a measure of liquid goods (not wine)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300386648">
